Description "Yoda

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.11x

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw (3) ^3[Saber CS1]
^2-- Damage: 40

^5Force Powers:
- Push (1)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (3)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- BP-Free Jumps
- Force-Flow Jumps
^1- Knockback Given: .5x
^1- Knockback Taken: 1.11x
^1- Hack Speed: .78x
^1- Skill Recharge: .76x"

A wise old Master who can fight on both extreme ends of the spectrum, thanks to centuries of Force training."